                           'execution frame, preserving local variables and '
                           'instruction pointers. Subsequent `next()` calls '
                           'resume execution right after the `yield`. When the '
                           'function finishes or encounters a `return`, it '
                           'raises a `StopIteration` exception. This lazy '
                           'evaluation mechanism achieves O(1) auxiliary '
                           'memory consumption when streaming large datasets, '
                           'files, or infinite sequences.',
