                                                           'locks must now be '
                                                           'coordinated across '
                                                           'network boundaries '
                                                           'using distributed '
                                                           'locking, '
                                                           'optimistic '
                                                           'concurrency, or '
                                                           'event-driven '
                                                           'messaging. Network '
                                                           'partitions and '
                                                           'variable latency '
                                                           'mean that '
                                                           'distributed '
                                                           'operations must be '
                                                           'designed to be '
                                                           'idempotent and '
                                                           'fault-tolerant. '
