                                                           'that had no match. '
                                                           'In production '
                                                           'architectures, '
                                                           'this SQL mechanism '
                                                           'ensures that state '
                                                           'transitions remain '
                                                           'predictable and '
                                                           'isolated under '
                                                           'concurrent '
                                                           'workloads. When '
                                                           'developers fail to '
                                                           'adhere to this '
                                                           'principle, subtle '
                                                           'race conditions or '
                                                           'resource leaks can '
                                                           'degrade system '
