                                                           'architecture, '
                                                           'local in-memory '
                                                           'assumptions no '
                                                           'longer hold. State '
                                                           'that was '
                                                           'previously '
                                                           'synchronized via '
                                                           'operating system '
                                                           'mutexes or thread '
                                                           'locks must now be '
                                                           'coordinated across '
                                                           'network boundaries '
                                                           'using distributed '
                                                           'locking, '
                                                           'optimistic '
                                                           'concurrency, or '
                                                           'event-driven '
                                                           'messaging. Network '
                                                           'partitions and '
                                                           'variable latency '
                                                           'mean that '
                                                           'distributed '
                                                           'operations must be '
                                                           'designed to be '
                                                           'idempotent and '
                                                           'fault-tolerant. '
                                                           'Additionally, '
                                                           'distributed '
                                                           'tracing headers '
                                                           'must be propagated '
