                                                           'that was '
                                                           'previously '
                                                           'synchronized via '
                                                           'operating system '
                                                           'mutexes or thread '
                                                           'locks must now be '
                                                           'coordinated across '
                                                           'network boundaries '
                                                           'using distributed '
