                                                           'process to a '
                                                           'distributed '
                                                           'architecture, '
                                                           'local in-memory '
                                                           'assumptions no '
                                                           'longer hold. State '
                                                           'that was '
                                                           'previously '
                                                           'synchronized via '
                                                           'operating system '
                                                           'mutexes or thread '
                                                           'locks must now be '
                                                           'coordinated across '
                                                           'network boundaries '
                                                           'using distributed '
                                                           'locking, '
                                                           'optimistic '
                                                           'concurrency, or '
                                                           'event-driven '
                                                           'messaging. Network '
                                                           'partitions and '
                                                           'variable latency '
                                                           'mean that '
                                                           'distributed '
                                                           'operations must be '
                                                           'designed to be '
                                                           'idempotent and '
                                                           'fault-tolerant. '
                                                           'Additionally, '
                                                           'distributed '
                                                           'tracing headers '
                                                           'must be propagated '
                                                           'across service '
                                                           'calls to maintain '
                                                           'end-to-end request '
                                                           'visibility. '
                                                           'Designing systems '
                                                           'with decoupled '
                                                           'domain boundaries '
                                                           'and explicit '
                                                           'contract schemas '
                                                           'ensures that '
                                                           'individual '
                                                           'microservices can '
                                                           'evolve '
                                                           'independently '
                                                           'without cascading '
                                                           'deployment '
                                                           'failures.',
